      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with you here. While it is nothing out of the ordinary due to these stutters happening already when loading worlds, avatars, menu etc. I would agree that these performance drops have become more noticeable. Avatar loading might be the easiest way to reproduce this. \n\nI would not immediately point it to the steamvr update though as I believe there are further issues surrounding the WMR compatibility with the latest steam library update.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
