      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems some users with Vive are also affected by strange loading problems with SteamVR. It's not more only WMR.\n\nMy friend Ray who has not very powerful system, has also shutter and freezes when loading world. It seems VRChat need some adjustments to try reduce freezings many as possible. Or SteamVR must fixed again to reduce strange loading issues.\n\nIf it's problem in the SteamVR part, VRChat crew should make report to Steam to fix the loading issues, so VRChat will run normal like before latest SteamVR update.\nVRChat crew must know what is exactly changed in SteamVR and provide some workarounds to reduce loading shutters / freezes.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
