      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are methods of using alternates that are more lightweight, such as OpenOVR, which can run SteamVR games without SteamVR, however it would merely be a check to ensure that SteamVR is the issue, and not VRChat. Plus, community made software like OpenOVR isn't compatible with all VR systems.",
