  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-10T18:14:54.507Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest changes in SteamVR (8 nov 2019) may have nice looking loading screen, VRChat is not so happy with it.\n\nWhen loading worlds or avatars, i have for some seconds shutter effect (sort of shaking picture) and it freezes a bit. This shaking effect is NOT seen with older version SteamVR.\n\nThe shaking effect seems happens too when openend VRC menu, the picture will shake again / freeze a bit for some seconds. If i do it many times, it's getting more annoying effect.\n\nI know it's due latest SteamVR update, VRChat is not more smooth when loading data. I hope you find a way to try make it more smoother when loading data (world / avatar / listings in menu) and not every time with short freeze / shaking / shuttering effect.\n\nThe shaking effect will also sometimes noticed when someone change the avatar in the world. I'm not sure others have also problems with small freeze / shaking effect, but i am using WMR headset. Please let VRC crew know if you have also short freezes with other VR systems.\n\nThank you.",
